{"hw":"προθυμέομαι","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">προθυμέομαι</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">προθυμ-έομαι</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">impf.</span> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <span class=\"gk\">προὐθυμούμην</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.12</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">402b</span> </span>; in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">προεθ-</span> (with v.l. προθ- ), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.78</span> </span>,<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.38</span> </span>, also in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> </span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">Ages..</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.1</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cra.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">395d</span> </span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\">fut.</span> <span class=\"gk\">προθυμήσομαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cyr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.3.3</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Men.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">74b</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Plt.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">262a</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">προθυμηθήσομαι</span> <abbr>v.l. in</abbr> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Lys.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">25.17</span> </span> and <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">P