n>, cf.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Phd.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">75b</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">La.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">186a</span> </span>, etc.; also <span class=\"gk\">π. ὅκως..</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.91</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Phd.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">91a</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">π.ὅθως ἂν εὐδαιμονοίης</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ly.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">207e</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ὡς ὑστερήσειε.., προεθυμεῖτο</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ages.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.1</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> abs. (though an <span class=\"lex-gram\">inf.</span> may commonly be supplied), <b class=\"lex-tr\">show zeal, exert oneself,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">383</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">630</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.86</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.38</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.81</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">An.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.4.22</span> </span>, etc.; <b class=\"lex-tr\">to be of good cheer, in good spirits,</b> opp. <span class=\"gk\">ἀθυμέω,</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cyr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.2.13</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">3</span> c. acc. objecti, <b class=\"lex-tr\">to be eager</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">zealous for, desire ardently,</b> <span class=\"gk\">τὴν ξύμβασιν, τὴν ὁμολογίαν,</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.17</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.90</span> </span>: mostly with neut. <span class=\"lex-gram\">Adj.</span>, <span class=\"gk\">π. τοῦτο, ὅπως..</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Antipho</span> </span> l.c.; <span class=\"gk\">μηδὲν ἄλλο ἢ τοῦτο</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Phd.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">64a</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">472e</span> </span>, al., <abbr>v.</abbr> l. in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">460d</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">π. περί τι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">HA</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">581a22</span> </span>.</div></div>"}